<%#
  The "Manage" affordance for a region that is not a photograph.

  locals:
    label  what the button says ("Manage", "Add a post", …)
    path   where it goes
    extra  a second link, as [label, path] (optional)

  A link, not an overlay: a collection, a paid post or a wishlist item has
  real fields, validation and pricing, and those belong on their own screen
  rather than in a hover card. Editing a post lands on the post editor, which
  is what you would expect from the pencil on a post anywhere else.

  Appears on hover of its section on a pointer device, and is always visible
  on touch, where there is no hover to reveal it.
%>
<div class="ie-manage">
  <%= link_to label, path, class: "ie-mini" %>
  <% if defined?(extra) && extra.present? %>
    <%= link_to extra[0], extra[1], class: "ie-mini" %>
  <% end %>
</div>
